+Initial checks exposed manual SubViewport resizing under stretch (corrected by letting its container own size), synthetic pressed-signal fixture input (replaced with real viewport mouse input), and an overflowing default ColorPicker (corrected with compact picker controls and opaque panel). Navigation regression points that previously crossed the static illustration now use the title region; new tests verify actual touch rotation does not navigate. No assertion was removed or weakened.
